### Broker/service health (503 when RabbitMQ is unavailable)
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### Consumed orders
GET http://localhost:4000/orders

### Summary
GET http://localhost:4000/analytics/summary

### Groups by product NAME
GET http://localhost:4000/analytics/products

### Top 3 by QUANTITY
GET http://localhost:4000/analytics/top-products

### Send through your EXISTING Node.js order-service, not the analytics API
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product": { "id": 1, "name": "Dog Food", "price": 19.99 },
  "quantity": 2,
  "totalPrice": 39.98
}
